---- EQ_CAP_PUMP_1  =L=  Pump capacity limit for Season 1 (2.2 acft/day * 182.5 days)

EQ_CAP_PUMP_1..  v_pumped1 - 401.5*v_build_pump =L= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- EQ_CAP_PUMP_2  =L=  Pump capacity limit for Season 2 (2.2 acft/day * 182.5 days)

EQ_CAP_PUMP_2..  v_pumped2 - 401.5*v_build_pump =L= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- EQ_PUMP_AVAIL_1  =L=  Water available to pump in Season 1 (Spill + 2.0 acft/day * 182.5 days)

